    "The ally launches the jet itself: its own spell power and attack power scale it, and the damage is its own. A warrior with +3000 attack power and one with +3000 spell power both read a jet 300 above a plain warrior.",
    "With the Venomancer on Kalimdor, an envenomed warrior swings for fifteen minutes, about 300 damaging swings; at 5% that is about 15 jets of its own, and 3 to 40 bounds a failure below 0.01% at 280 swings."
